				&lt;span style="font-family:'MS Reference Sans Serif'"&gt;13. Effective January 29, 2025, Taylor K. Jon was removed as Senior Vice President and Chief Financial Officer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'MS Reference Sans Serif'"&gt;Effective March 7, 2025, Swann, Mary M. was removed as Corporate Secretary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'MS Reference Sans Serif'"&gt;Effective March 7, 2025, Sealy, Karen was named as Corporate Secretary.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'MS Reference Sans Serif'"&gt;Effective March 21, 2025, Storsin, Joseph M. was removed as Vice President, Finance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'MS Reference Sans Serif'"&gt;Effective January 21, 2025, Taylor, K. Jon was removed as Director.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'MS Reference Sans Serif'"&gt;Effective January 21, 2025, Henry, Michelle R. was removed as Director.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'MS Reference Sans Serif'"&gt;Effective January 21, 2025, Smith, A. Wade was named Director.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'MS Reference Sans Serif'"&gt;Effective January 21, 2025, Thomas, Toby L was named Director.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
