      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <div>
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: 400; line-height: 115%;">The annual revenue requirement and Point-to-Point rates are filed in FERC Docket No.</span>
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: 400; line-height: 115%;">ER21-265-000</span>
          <span style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: 400; line-height: 115%;">. The annual revenue requirement is allocated to a monthly revenue, and this monthly revenue along with Point-to-Point revenues are paid to KatCo through PJM.</span>
        </div>
        <div>&#160;</div>
        <div>
          <table style="border-collapse: collapse; display: inline-table; margin-bottom: 5pt; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 93.005%;">
